25:["$","section","One award can have multiple deadlines",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One award can have multiple deadlines"}],[["$","p","The University of Toronto Pearson process illustrates why an award cannot always be reduced to one date: the school nomination, undergraduate admission and award application close on different days. Use the Pearson guide for the complete sequence; this table lists individual opportunity records and cannot replace every linked institutional calendar.",{"children":"The University of Toronto Pearson process illustrates why an award cannot always be reduced to one date: the school nomination, undergraduate admission and award application close on different days. Use the Pearson guide for the complete sequence; this table lists individual opportunity records and cannot replace every linked institutional calendar."}],["$","p","A Chevening applicant has a 6 October 2026 scholarship deadline but must also plan for UK course admission and a later offer stage. KAUST's Spring deadline has passed and its Fall 2027 MS, MS/PhD and PhD round is open until 3 January 2027. Reopen each programme's official timeline before applying.",{"children":"A Chevening applicant has a 6 October 2026 scholarship deadline but must also plan for UK course admission and a later offer stage. KAUST's Spring deadline has passed and its Fall 2027 MS, MS/PhD and PhD round is open until 3 January 2027. Reopen each programme's official timeline before applying."}]],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","School or sending-partner nomination",{"children":"School or sending-partner nomination"}],["$","li","Scholarship portal submission",{"children":"Scholarship portal submission"}],["$","li","University admission or offer",{"children":"University admission or offer"}],["$","li","Language documents and interview",{"children":"Language documents and interview"}],["$","li","Exact local time and time zone",{"children":"Exact local time and time zone"}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
